    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "2",
      "description": "<p>The dragon breathes a translucent mist of potentialities that overwhelms creatures with visions of possible features, dealing @Damage[6d6[mental]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[cone|distance:20] (@Check[will|dc:25|options:area-effect] save). A creature that fails its save is Slowed 1 for 1 round (or Slowed 2 on a critical failure) as it struggles with the visions.</p>\n<p>The dragon can't use Destiny Breath again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Destiny Breath]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Destiny Breath",
      "requirements": null,
